{
  "id": "gateways",
  "title": "Calling a method in another language",
  "summary": "`@Gateway` declares a method that code in another language answers. The target is a class in another Yon language, such as `server/services/ReportService.java`. It can also be a program, such as `python3 server/helpers/forecast.py`. The arguments are sent as JSON, within fixed limits. The answer becomes the result of the method. A failure becomes a `BehaviorError` with a fixed message. The build checks every target. Only one hop (one call from one language to another) is allowed.",
